{"step_index":67,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-12T04:58:32Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-12T10:28:32+05:30\nCompleted At: 2026-09-12T10:28:32+05:30\nFile Path: `file:///C:/Users/Piyush/.gemini/antigravity/builtin/skills/generative_ui/SKILL.md`\nTotal Lines: 122\nTotal Bytes: 5650\nShowing lines 1 to 122\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n1: ---\n2: name: generative_ui\n3: description: How to render rich interactive HTML widgets inline in the chat or as standalone artifacts. Use this skill when you want to show the user diagrams, data visualizations, interactive controls, educational walkthroughs, or any rich visual content beyond plain text and markdown.\n4: ---\n5: \n6: # Generative UI\n7: \n8: You can render custom, rich, interactive user interfaces (inline widgets or\n9: larger artifacts) directly in the chat. This is a great way to communicate\n10: complex information to the user, generate rich visualizations, and even create\n11: small interactive experiences for the user.\n12: \n13: ## Workflow\n14: \n15: 1.  **Create the HTML Artifact**: Use `write_to_file` to save a self-contained\n16:     `.html` file (using Tailwind CSS and inline JavaScript) to the artifact\n17:     directory. Set `UserFacing: true` in `ArtifactMetadata`.\n18: 2.  **Embed Inline (optional)**: Include the `<agent-embed>` tag in your chat\n19:     response, if you decide this html artifact should be rendered inline in the\n20:     conversation:\n21: \n22:     ```\n23:     <agent-embed src=\"file:///<artifact_path>/widget.html\"></agent-embed>\n24:     ```\n25: \n26: ## Constraints & Theming\n27: \n28: *   **External Assets & Tailwind CSS**: All external CDNs are blocked by CSP,\n29:     except for one allowlisted gstatic Tailwind dependency that you **CAN** and\n30:     **SHOULD** use to style your artifacts. Include the following script tag in\n31:     your `<head>` to enable Tailwind:\n32: \n33:     ```html\n34:     <script src=\"https://www.gstatic.com/antigravity/web/dev/tailwindcss.min.js\"></script>\n35:     ```\n36: \n37: *   **Use Provided Theme Variables**: The iframe injects the app's semantic\n38:     design-system tokens, so widgets automatically match the host theme and the\n39:     user's custom colors. Surfaces (`--background`, `--content`, `--card`,\n40:     `--sidebar`), borders (`--border`), text (`--foreground`,\n41:     `--muted-foreground`, `--placeholder`), and accents\n42:     (`--primary`/`--primary-foreground`, `--secondary`/`--secondary-foreground`,\n43:     `--accent`) are all available. Typography is applied for you on the document\n44:     body — you do not need to set a font.\n45: \n46: *   **Text & Surface Colors**: Use semantic variables (`bg-[var(--card)]`,\n47:     `text-[var(--foreground)]`, `text-[var(--muted-foreground)]`)\n48:     instead of hardcoded dark/light utility classes (e.g., `bg-slate-900`,\n49:     `text-white`) to ensure high contrast across both light and dark themes.\n50: \n51: *   **Do Not Declare Local Fallbacks on `:root`**: Never define local color\n52:     fallbacks on `:root` in a `<style>` block; the host environment manages\n53:     theme variables dynamically.\n54: \n55: *   **HTML Boilerplate Template**: Recommended base template:\n56: \n57:     ```html\n58:     <!DOCTYPE html>\n59:     <html>\n60:     <head>\n61:       <script src=\"https://www.gstatic.com/antigravity/web/dev/tailwindcss.min.js\"></script>\n62:     </head>\n63:     <body class=\"bg-transparent text-[var(--foreground)] antialiased p-5\">\n64:       <div class=\"bg-[var(--card)] text-[var(--foreground)] border border-[var(--border)] rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm\">\n65:         <h2 class=\"text-[var(--foreground)] font-semibold text-lg\">Title</h2>\n66:         <p class=\"text-[var(--muted-foreground)] text-sm\">Description</p>\n67:         <!-- Interactive content goes here -->\n68:       </div>\n69:     </body>\n70:     </html>\n71:     ```\n72: \n73: *   **General styling**: Aim for a clean, premium aesthetic. For `<canvas>`,\n74:     check `document.documentElement.classList.contains('light')` to adapt\n75:     colors.\n76: \n77: ## Deciding on Placement (Inline vs. Standalone)\n78: \n79: **Default to artifact only** — reference the HTML artifact in your response and\n80: let the user open it in the side pane. Consider inlining when the widget is\n81: compact (comfortably under 500px tall) and directly illustrates the surrounding\n82: explanation (e.g., a small educational widget, plot, or diagram). Larger, more\n83: complex content (data dashboards, simulations, app prototypes) should stay\n84: artifact-only. Always follow the user's explicit preference if stated.\n85: \n86: ## Designing Inline Widgets (Cards & Transparency)\n87: \n88: When embedding inline in chat (`<agent-embed>`), style widgets as native chat\n89: components:\n90: \n91: *   **Transparent Root Background**: Always set `<body class=\"bg-transparent\n92:     ...\">` so the widget blends seamlessly into the chat container.\n93: *   **Card-Based Layouts**: Wrap inline content and controls in a card container\n94:     (as shown in the Boilerplate Template above) to provide elevation and\n95:     prevent loose text in light mode.\n96: *   **Standalone Artifacts**: For full-page side-pane artifacts (like\n97:     dashboards), use a solid background (e.g., `bg-[var(--background)]`).\n98: \n99: ## Sizing Inline Embeds\n100: \n101: For inline embeds, it is important to think **small and compact**.\n102: \n103: Inline embeds only have a **500px** height viewport. Past that the widget\n104: scrolls inside a small box and the user sees only a fragment of what you built,\n105: so don't build inlined widgets that are too tall.\n106: \n107: *   **Do not set a `height` attribute on `<agent-embed>`.** It is ignored.\n108: *   **Think compact** Think carefully about designing something that is compact\n109:     and fits nicely inline in the chat height budget.\n110: *   **If the idea genuinely needs more room, make it a standalone artifact.** A\n111:     scrolling inline widget is usually wrong — full-height in the side pane\n112:     beats cropped in the chat.\n113: \n114: After generating the artifact, consider whether it is sufficiently compact to be\n115: useful inline and adjust if needed.\n116: \n117: > [!IMPORTANT] Never size an inline widget relative to the viewport: no\n118: > `h-screen`, `min-h-screen`, `100vh`, or `height: 100%` on a top-level\n119: > container. The frame's viewport is derived from your content, so these feed\n120: > themselves and the widget collapses to a sliver. Use padding for breathing\n121: > room instead.\n122: \nThe above content shows the entire, complete file contents of the requested file.\n"}
{"step_index":68,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-12T04:58:32Z","thinking":"**Designing an Amazing AegisOS Frontend**\n\nThe user's request centers on crafting a high-quality frontend for AegisOS, aiming for an exceptional user experience.  A standalone HTML web dashboard artifact, specifically an interactive mission control simulator, offers a promising direction. This approach allows for a visually engaging and functional interface.\n\n\n**Defining Interactive Frontend Features**\n\nThe mission control console will feature an interactive virtual desktop OS simulator demonstrating an ERP app with animated UI elements. It needs to support mode switching between a standard UI and a chaotic UI drift mode with self-healing features and real-time episodic memory graph updates.\n\nSecurity breach simulations will involve malicious payload injection, boundary hypervisor interception, alert flashing, and state rollback, confirmed with SHA-256 proofs. A live, canvas-based knowledge graph visualizer will represent cached nodes, connections, and drift recalibration.\n\nFinally, a live telemetry stream should display color-coded invariant checks and timing benchmarks to monitor system integrity.\n\n\n**Defining Frontend Visual Design**\n\nThe visual design should adhere to a defined aesthetic and design system. The goal is to craft a futuristic and immersive interface, employing a carefully selected color palette for visual cues and glassmorphism for depth. Incorporating subtle grid patterns and glowing borders aims to enhance the futuristic feel.\n\nStatus indicators will provide dynamic feedback through animated radar blips, interactive chips, and real-time latency displays, all in line with the chosen aesthetic. These elements will contribute to a responsive and engaging user experience.\n\n\n**Defining UI and System Simulation**\n\nThe UI will feature distinct panels: a simulated virtual desktop, an episodic memory graph visualizer, and a boundary hypervisor with telemetry. The virtual desktop will simulate a legacy ERP system with interactive elements, mouse cursor, and animated fields.  The memory graph will represent UI node relationships and spatial distances, animating relocation vectors upon drift. The hypervisor will present boundary contract status, proof-of-boundary details, and a live console log.\n\n\n**Integrating Audio & UI Frameworks**\n\nThe plan is to integrate the specified audio feedback into the interactive UI, focusing on zero-dependency synthesized sound effects triggered by specific events. This includes sounds for node interactions, button presses, drift detection, and boundary violations.\n\nThe generative UI skill constraint to include a specified UI framework script needs to be applied, utilizing theme variables when possible or self-contained styles.  The code will also output to two target files, the primary artifact and a scratch file.\n\nThe core of the interaction will be driven by a comprehensive state machine and corresponding functions to execute the described UI acts, including the automation of hands-on Act 1 and triggering Act 2 drift.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Ultra-high-fidelity interactive Frontend Mission Control and Simulator for AegisOS. Features virtual desktop OS actuation simulation, live episodic memory graph visualization on HTML5 canvas, deterministic boundary hypervisor with cryptographic Proof-of-Boundary cards, synthesized Web Audio sound effects, and 3-Act live demo automation.","UserFacing":true},"CodeContent":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"dark\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>AegisOS :: Ambient Mission Control & Spatial Actuator</title>\n  <script src=\"https://www.gstatic.com/antigravity/web/dev/tailwindcss.min.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=JetBrains+Mono:ital,wght@0,300;0,400;0,600;0,800;1,400&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;600;700&display=swap');\n\n    :root {\n      --font-mono: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;\n      --font-display: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;\n    }\n\n    body {\n      font-family: var(--font-display);\n      background-color: #05070d;\n      color: #e2e8f0;\n      overflow-x: hidden;\n    }\n\n    .font-mono {\n      font-family: var(--font-mono);\n    }\n\n    /* Cyberpunk / Glassmorphic glowing utilities */\n    .glass-panel {\n      background: rgba(11, 17, 32, 0.85);\n      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15);\n      box-shadow: 0 8px 32px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);\n    }\n\n    .glass-panel-danger {\n      background: rgba(35, 11, 19, 0.9);\n      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.4);\n      box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.25);\n    }\n\n    .glow-cyan {\n      box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.35);\n    }\n\n    .glow-emerald {\n      box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.35);\n    }\n\n    .glow-crimson {\n      box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.6);\n      animation: pulse-danger 1.5s infinite;\n    }\n\n    @keyframes pulse-danger {\n      0%, 100% { box-shadow: 0 0 15px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.4); }\n      50% { box-shadow: 0 0 35px rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.85); }\n    }\n\n    /* Scanline overlay */\n    .scanlines {\n      background: linear-gradient(\n        rgba(18, 16, 16, 0) 50%, \n        rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25) 50%\n      ), linear-gradient(\n        90deg,\n        rgba(255, 0, 0, 0.03),\n        rgba(0, 255, 0, 0.01),\n        rgba(0, 0, 255, 0.03)\n      );\n      background-size: 100% 3px, 3px 100%;\n      pointer-events: none;\n    }\n\n    /* Smooth virtual cursor */\n    #virtual-cursor {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 100px;\n      left: 100px;\n      width: 24px;\n      height: 24px;\n      pointer-events: none;\n      z-index: 999;\n      transition: top 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1), left 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);\n    }\n\n    #virtual-cursor.clicking svg {\n      transform: scale(0.8) rotate(-8deg);\n    }\n\n    /* Custom scrollbar */\n    ::-webkit-scrollbar {\n      width: 5px;\n      height: 5px;\n    }\n    ::-webkit-scrollbar-track {\n      background: #090d16;\n    }\n    ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {\n      background: #1e293b;\n      border-radius: 4px;\n    }\n    ::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {\n      background: #38bdf8;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"min-h-screen bg-[#05070d] text-slate-100 flex flex-col antialiased selection:bg-cyan-500 selection:text-black\">\n\n  <!-- TOP HUD NAVIGATION -->\n  <header class=\"border-b border-cyan-900/40 bg-[#080d18]/90 backdrop-blur sticky top-0 z-50 px-6 py-3.5 flex items-center justify-between\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center space-x-4\">\n      <div class=\"relative flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 rounded-lg bg-cyan-500/10 border border-cyan-400/30 text-cyan-400 font-mono font-black text-xl shadow-[0_0_15px_rgba(56,189,248,0.2)]\">\n        Æ\n        <span class=\"absolute -top-1 -right-1 w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-emerald-400 rounded-full animate-ping\"></span>\n        <span class=\"absolute -top-1 -right-1 w-2.5 h-2.5 bg-emerald-400 rounded-full\"></span>\n      </div>\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center space-x-2\">\n          <h1 class=\"font-extrabold tracking-wider text-lg text-white\">AEGIS<span class=\"text-cyan-400 font-mono\">::OS</span></h1>\n          <span class=\"text-[10px] uppercase font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-cyan-950 text-cyan-300 border border-cyan-800\">Mission Control</span>\n          <span class=\"text-[10px] uppercase font-mono px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-indigo-950 text-indigo-300 border border-indigo-800\">Zero-Chat Architecture</span>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"text-xs text-slate-400 hidden md:block\">Autonomous Ambient Desktop Operator with Sensory Hands, Episodic Memory & Formal Boundary Contracts</p>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Live Status Indicators & Action Bar -->\n    <div class=\"flex items-center space-x-3 font-mono text-xs\">\n      <div id=\"system-status-badge\" class=\"px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-emerald-950/80 border border-emerald-500/40 text-emerald-300 flex items-center space-x-2\">\n        <span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-pulse\"></span>\n        <span id=\"system-status-text\">SYSTEM ARMED // IDLE</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <button id=\"btn-sound-toggle\" onclick=\"toggleAudio()\" class=\"px-3 py-1 rounded bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 text-slate-300 hover:text-white hover:border-cyan-500 transition\">\n        🔊 AUDIO: <span id=\"sound-state\">ON</span>\n      </button>\n\n      <button onclick=\"runFullDemo()\" class=\"px-4 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-500 to-blue-600 hover:from-cyan-400 hover:to-blue-500 text-slate-950 font-bold tracking-wide shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(56,189,248,0.4)] transition transform active:scale-95 flex items-center space-x-1.5\">\n        <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 fill-current\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M8 5v14l11-7z\"/></svg>\n        <span>RUN 3-ACT DEMO</span>\n      </button>\n\n      <button onclick=\"resetSystem()\" class=\"px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-900 border border-slate-700 hover:border-slate-500 text-slate-400 hover:text-white transition\">\n        ↺ RESET\n      </button>\n    </div>\n  </header>\n\n  <!-- MAIN OPERATIONAL GRID -->\n  <main class=\"flex-1 p-5 grid grid-cols-12 gap-5 max-w-[1920px] mx-auto w-full\">\n\n    <!-- LEFT COLUMN: THE HANDS & VIRTUAL OS WORKSPACE (5 COLS) -->\n    <section class=\"col-span-12 lg:col-span-5 flex flex-col space-y-4\">\n      \n      <!-- OS Window Simulation Card -->\n      <div class=\"glass-panel rounded-xl overflow-hidden flex flex-col h-[560px] relative border-cyan-500/20\">\n        \n        <!-- OS Title Bar -->\n        <div class=\"bg-slate-900/90 border-b border-slate-800 px-3.5 py-2 flex items-center justify-between\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center space-x-2 text-xs font-mono text-slate-300\">\n            <span class=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-red-500/80 inline-block\"></span>\n            <span class=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-yellow-500/80 inline-block\"></span>\n            <span class=\"w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-green-500/80 inline-block\"></span>\n            <span class=\"ml-2 font-semibold text-slate-200\">Legacy Enterprise Financial ERP v4.2 [WIN32]</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"flex items-center space-x-2 text-[11px] font-mono text-cyan-400\">\n            <span>PORT: 8080</span>\n            <span class=\"px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-cyan-950 border border-cyan-800/60\">ACTUATION SANDBOX</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Virtual Screen Content Area -->\n        <div id=\"desktop-viewport\" class=\"relative flex-1 bg-slate-200 p-5 overflow-hidden font-sans select-none text-slate-900\">\n          \n          <!-- Animated Virtual OS Cursor -->\n          <div id=\"virtual-cursor\" style=\"top: 220px; left: 240px;\">\n            <svg class=\"w-6 h-6 text-black drop-shadow-[0_2px_8px_rgba(0,0,0,0.6)] transition-transform\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\">\n              <path d=\"M4 0l16 12.279-6.951 1.17 4.325 8.817-3.596 1.734-4.35-8.879-5.428 5.239z\"/>\n            </svg>\n            <div id=\"cursor-target-ring\" class=\"absolute -top-3 -left-3 w-12 h-12 border-2 border-cyan-500 rounded-full opacity-0 scale-50 transition-all pointer-events-none\"></div>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Enterprise Form Mockup -->\n          <div class=\"bg-white rounded border border-slate-400 shadow-sm p-4\">\n            <div class=\"border-b border-slate-300 pb-2 mb-3 flex justify-between items-center\">\n              <div>\n                <h3 class=\"text-xs font-bold text-slate-800 tracking-wide uppercase\">Transaction Settlement Voucher</h3>\n                <p class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-500 font-mono\">DISBURSEMENT PIPELINE :: STRICT COMPLIANCE</p>\n              </div>\n              <span id=\"erp-stamp\" class=\"text-[9px] font-mono px-2 py-0.5 border border-slate-400 text-slate-600 rounded bg-slate-100\">READY</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Inputs -->\n            <div class=\"space-y-2 text-xs\">\n              <div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 items-center\">\n                <label class=\"text-slate-600 font-semibold text-[11px]\">Vendor Name:</label>\n                <input id=\"input-vendor\" type=\"text\" readonly class=\"col-span-2 px-2 py-1 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-300 rounded font-mono text-slate-800 text-xs focus:bg-white focus:border-blue-600 transition\" placeholder=\"Awaiting actuation...\">\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 items-center\">\n                <label class=\"text-slate-600 font-semibold text-[11px]\">Invoice ID:</label>\n                <input id=\"input-invoice\" type=\"text\" readonly class=\"col-span-2 px-2 py-1 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-300 rounded font-mono text-slate-800 text-xs\" placeholder=\"e.g. INV-2026-XXX\">\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 items-center\">\n                <label class=\"text-slate-600 font-semibold text-[11px]\">Amount ($):</label>\n                <input id=\"input-amount\" type=\"text\" readonly class=\"col-span-2 px-2 py-1 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-300 rounded font-mono text-slate-800 text-xs font-bold\" placeholder=\"0.00\">\n              </div>\n              <div class=\"grid grid-cols-3 items-center\">\n                <label class=\"text-slate-600 font-semibold text-[11px]\">Audit Memo:</label>\n                <input id=\"input-notes\" type=\"text\" readonly class=\"col-span-2 px-2 py-1 bg-slate-50 border border-slate-300 rounded font-mono text-slate-800 text-xs\" placeholder=\"Operational directive memo\">\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Dynamic Action Buttons Frame (Target for UI Drift!) -->\n            <div id=\"erp-actions-container\" class=\"mt-4 pt-3 border-t border-slate-200 flex items-center justify-between relative min-h-[46px] transition-all duration-500\">\n              <button id=\"btn-erp-submit\" class=\"px-4 py-1.5 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-semibold text-xs rounded shadow-sm transition-all duration-300 flex items-center space-x-1\">\n                <span>[ Process & Wire Payout ]</span>\n              </button>\n\n              <button id=\"btn-erp-purge\" class=\"px-3 py-1.5 bg-rose-700 hover:bg-rose-800 text-white text-[11px] font-semibold rounded shadow-sm transition\">\n                <span>[ Purge Audit Trail ]</span>\n              </button>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Legacy Ledger Table -->\n          <div class=\"mt-3 bg-white rounded border border-slate-400 p-2.5\">\n            <div class=\"text-[10px] font-mono text-slate-600 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-1 flex justify-between\">\n              <span>Settled Transaction Ledger (SQLite v3)</span>\n              <span id=\"ledger-count\" class=\"text-blue-600 font-bold\">0 records</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"overflow-y-auto max-h-[140px] font-mono text-[10px] border border-slate-200 rounded\">\n              <table class=\"w-full text-left\">\n                <thead class=\"bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 border-b border-slate-200 sticky top-0\">\n                  <tr>\n                    <th class=\"p-1\">Time</th>\n                    <th class=\"p-1\">Voucher</th>\n                    <th class=\"p-1\">Vendor</th>\n                    <th class=\"p-1 text-right\">Amount</th>\n                  </tr>\n                </thead>\n                <tbody id=\"ledger-rows\" class=\"divide-y divide-slate-100 text-slate-700\">\n                  <tr>\n                    <td colspan=\"4\" class=\"p-2 text-center text-slate-400 italic\">No payouts committed in current session</td>\n                  </tr>\n                </tbody>\n              </table>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Bottom Chaos Drift Alert Banner (Shown during drift) -->\n          <div id=\"drift-alert-banner\" class=\"absolute bottom-2 left-2 right-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded bg-amber-500 text-slate-950 font-mono text-[11px] font-bold shadow-lg transform translate-y-12 opacity-0 transition-all flex items-center justify-between\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center space-x-1.5\">\n              <span class=\"animate-ping w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-slate-950\"></span>\n              <span>⚡ CHAOS SABOTAGE: BUTTON RELOCATED (Δx=+240px, Δy=-40px)</span>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"text-[9px] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-black text-amber-300\">ENTROPY INJECTED</span>\n          </div>\n\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- OS Actuation Telemetry Footer -->\n        <div class=\"bg-slate-900 border-t border-slate-800 px-4 py-2 flex items-center justify-between text-[11px] font-mono text-slate-400\">\n          <div class=\"flex items-center space-x-3\">\n            <span class=\"text-cyan-400 font-semibold\">ACTUATOR:</span>\n            <span id=\"telemetry-coords\">CURSOR: (240, 220)</span>\n            <span id=\"telemetry-fps\">PERCEPTION: 60 FPS</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"flex items-center space-x-2\">\n            <button onclick=\"simulateManualDrift()\" class=\"text-amber-400 hover:text-amber-300 text-[10px] underline\">\n              [⚡ Trigger Chaos Drift]\n            </button>\n            <button onclick=\"simulateManualAttack()\" class=\"text-rose-400 hover:text-rose-300 text-[10px] underline\">\n              [💀 Inject Malicious Attack]\n            </button>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Quick Concept Explanation Card -->\n      <div class=\"glass-panel rounded-xl p-4 text-xs space-y-2 border-slate-800\">\n        <h3 class=\"font-mono text-cyan-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center space-x-2\">\n          <span>Pillar 1: Sensory-Motor OS \"Hands\"</span>\n        </h3>\n        <p class=\"text-slate-300 leading-relaxed\">\n          AegisOS replaces conversational prompts with raw sensory perception and motor actuation. It operates over any legacy ERP, desktop software, or browser portal via smooth cursor kinematics, character typing cadence, and spatial coordinate anchoring.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- CENTER COLUMN: EPISODIC MEMORY GRAPH & SELF-HEALING (4 COLS) -->\n    <section class=\"col-span-12 lg:col-span-4 flex flex-col space-y-4\">\n      \n      <!-- Memory Graph Card -->\n      <div class=\"glass-panel rounded-xl flex flex-col h-[560px] overflow-hidden border-indigo-500/20\">\n        \n        <!-- Header -->\n        <div class=\"bg-slate-900/90 border-b border-slate-800 px-4 py-2.5 flex items-center justify-between\">\n          <div>\n            <h2 class=\"font-mono font-bold text-xs text-indigo-300 tracking-wider uppercase flex items-center space-x-1.5\">\n              <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-indigo-400\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z\"/></svg>\n              <span>Episodic Memory Graph</span>\n            </h2>\n            <p class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-400\">Pillar 2: Spatial Muscle Memory & Self-Healing</p>\n          </div>\n          <span id=\"memory-cache-badge\" class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-indigo-950 border border-indigo-700/60 font-mono text-[10px] text-indigo-300 font-bold\">\n            6 NODES SYNCED\n          </span>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Interactive Canvas Graph Container -->\n        <div class=\"relative flex-1 bg-[#070b14] overflow-hidden\">\n          <canvas id=\"memory-canvas\" class=\"w-full h-full block\"></canvas>\n\n          <!-- Floating Graph Overlay Stats -->\n          <div class=\"absolute top-3 left-3 bg-slate-900/80 backdrop-blur border border-slate-800 rounded p-2 text-[10px] font-mono space-y-1\">\n            <div class=\"text-slate-400\">MUSCLE MEMORY CONFIDENCE: <span id=\"graph-confidence\" class=\"text-emerald-400 font-bold\">98.4%</span></div>\n            <div class=\"text-slate-400\">DRIFT RE-ANCHORS: <span id=\"graph-drifts\" class=\"text-amber-400 font-bold\">0</span></div>\n            <div class=\"text-slate-400\">ACTIVE TASK: <span id=\"graph-active-task\" class=\"text-cyan-400 font-bold\">IDLE</span></div>\n          </div>\n\n          <!-- Self-Healing Notification Toast Overlay -->\n          <div id=\"self-heal-toast\" class=\"absolute bottom-3 left-3 right-3 p-2.5 rounded bg-indigo-950/90 border border-indigo-400/40 text-indigo-200 text-xs font-mono opacity-0 transform translate-y-4 transition-all shadow-xl\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center space-x-2 text-indigo-300 font-bold text-[11px] mb-1\">\n              <span class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-indigo-400 animate-pulse\"></span>\n              <span>EPISODIC SELF-HEAL ENGAGED</span>\n            </div>\n            <div id=\"self-heal-desc\" class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-300\">Target relocalized. Muscle memory edge updated in SQLite.</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Memory Nodes Table -->\n        <div class=\"bg-slate-950 border-t border-slate-800 p-3 max-h-[140px] overflow-y-auto font-mono text-[11px]\">\n          <div class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-500 uppercase font-bold mb-1\">Active Spatial Landmarks:</div>\n          <div class=\"space-y-1\" id=\"memory-nodes-list\">\n            <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center text-slate-300 py-0.5 border-b border-slate-900\">\n              <span class=\"text-cyan-400\">● node_vendor_input</span>\n              <span class=\"text-slate-500\">(x:145, y:82)</span>\n              <span class=\"text-emerald-400 text-[10px]\">100% confidence</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center text-slate-300 py-0.5 border-b border-slate-900\">\n              <span class=\"text-cyan-400\">● node_amount_input</span>\n              <span class=\"text-slate-500\">(x:145, y:142)</span>\n              <span class=\"text-emerald-400 text-[10px]\">100% confidence</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center text-slate-300 py-0.5 border-b border-slate-900\">\n              <span id=\"node-submit-label\" class=\"text-cyan-400\">● node_submit_btn</span>\n              <span id=\"node-submit-coords\" class=\"text-slate-500\">(x:110, y:230)</span>\n              <span id=\"node-submit-status\" class=\"text-emerald-400 text-[10px]\">CACHED</span>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Memory Explanation Card -->\n      <div class=\"glass-panel rounded-xl p-4 text-xs space-y-2 border-slate-800\">\n        <h3 class=\"font-mono text-indigo-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center space-x-2\">\n          <span>Pillar 2: Self-Learning & Adaptation</span>\n        </h3>\n        <p class=\"text-slate-300 leading-relaxed\">\n          Unlike brittle RPA scripts that break when layouts change, AegisOS maintains an episodic visual-spatial graph. When visual drift occurs, it autonomously relocalizes the target, executes, and updates its memory graph so future iterations run at instant macro speed.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- RIGHT COLUMN: BOUNDARY HYPERVISOR & AUDIT TELEMETRY (3 COLS) -->\n    <section class=\"col-span-12 lg:col-span-3 flex flex-col space-y-4\">\n      \n      <!-- Boundary Hypervisor Enclave Card -->\n      <div id=\"hypervisor-card\" class=\"glass-panel rounded-xl flex flex-col h-[560px] overflow-hidden border-cyan-500/20 transition-all duration-500\">\n        \n        <!-- Header -->\n        <div class=\"bg-slate-900/90 border-b border-slate-800 px-4 py-2.5 flex items-center justify-between\">\n          <div>\n            <h2 class=\"font-mono font-bold text-xs text-rose-300 tracking-wider uppercase flex items-center space-x-1.5\">\n              <svg class=\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-rose-400\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z\"/></svg>\n              <span>Boundary Hypervisor</span>\n            </h2>\n            <p class=\"text-[10px] text-slate-400\">Pillar 3: Guardrails, Boundaries & Trust</p>\n          </div>\n          <span id=\"blast-radius-badge\" class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-emerald-950 border border-emerald-700/60 font-mono text-[10px] text-emerald-300 font-bold\">\n            ZERO LEAK\n          </span>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Boundary Contracts Status -->\n        <div class=\"p-3 bg-slate-950/60 border-b border-slate-800 font-mono text-[10px] space-y-2\">\n          <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center text-slate-400\">\n            <span>MAX TRANSACTION CEILING:</span>\n            <span class=\"text-cyan-400 font-bold\">$5,000.00</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center text-slate-400\">\n            <span>PROHIBITED COMMAND FILTER:</span>\n            <span class=\"text-emerald-400 font-bold\">ACTIVE (PURGE/FORMAT)</span>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"flex justify-between items-center text-slate-400\">\n            <span>PRE-ACTION ATOMIC SNAPSHOTS:</span>\n            <span class=\"text-emerald-400 font-bold\">ENABLED</span>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Cryptographic Proof-of-Boundary Box -->\n        <div class=\"p-3 border-b border-slate-800\">\n          <div class=\"text-[10px] font-mono font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-2 flex items-center justify-between\">\n            <span>Proof-of-Boundary (PoB)</span>\n            <span id=\"pob-status\" class=\"text-[9px] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded bg-slate-800 text-slate-400\">STANDBY</span>\n          </div>\n\n          <div id=\"pob-card\" class=\"bg-slate-900 border border-slate-800 rounded p-2.5 font-mono text-[10px] space-y-1.5 transition-all\">\n            <div class=\"text-slate-400\">LAST EVALUATION: <span id=\"pob-last-eval\" class=\"text-slate-200\">Pending next directive</span></div>\n            <div class=\"text-slate-400\">INTEGRITY HASH:</div>\n            <div id=\"pob-hash\" class=\"text-[9px] text-slate-500 break-all bg-black/50 p-1 rounded font-mono\">e3b0c44298fc1c149afbf4c8996fb92427ae41e4649b934ca495991b7852b855</div>\n            <div id=\"pob-alert-text\" class=\"text-slate-400 text-[10px]\">Status: Pre-flight invariant engine ready.</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Telemetry Audit Stream -->\n        <div class=\"flex-1 flex flex-col p-3 overflow-hidden bg-black/40\">\n          <div class=\"text-[10px] font-mono font-bold text-slate-400 uppercase tracking-wider mb-1\">\n            <span>Live Audit Telemetry</span>\n          </div>\n          <div id=\"telemetry-log\" class=\"flex-1 overflow-y-auto font-mono text-[10px] space-y-1 text-slate-300 pr-1\">\n            <div class=\"text-cyan-500\">[00:00:01] System boot: AegisOS kernel initialized.</div>\n            <div class=\"text-emerald-400\">[00:00:02] Invariant contracts loaded: 3 policies active.</div>\n            <div class=\"text-slate-400\">[00:00:03] Ready for operational directives.</div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Boundaries Explanation Card -->\n      <div class=\"glass-panel rounded-xl p-4 text-xs space-y-2 border-slate-800\">\n        <h3 class=\"font-mono text-rose-400 font-bold uppercase tracking-wider flex items-center space-x-2\">\n          <span>Pillar 3: Guardrails & Trust</span>\n        </h3>\n        <p class=\"text-slate-300 leading-relaxed\">\n          AI agents cannot be trusted in enterprise or production with simple prompt guardrails. AegisOS enforces deterministic pre-flight invariants: if an action exceeds budget or invokes prohibited system mutations, actuation halts at the OS event level.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n\n    </section>\n\n  </main>\n\n  <!-- FOOTER & AUDIO CONTROLLER -->\n  <footer class=\"border-t border-slate-800/80 bg-[#080d18] px-6 py-2.5 flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-mono text-slate-500\">\n    <div>\n      TRACK 01: AI & AUTOMATION // SUBTRACKS: AGENTIC WORKFLOWS • SELF-LEARNING & ADAPTATION • GUARDRAILS & TRUST\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"flex items-center space-x-4 text-[11px]\">\n      <span class=\"text-cyan-400\">NO CHAT BOTS</span>\n      <span>•</span>\n      <span class=\"text-indigo-400\">AUTONOMOUS ACTUATION</span>\n      <span>•</span>\n      <span class=\"text-rose-400\">PROVABLE BOUNDARIES</span>\n    </div>\n  </footer>\n\n  <!-- SCRIPT: INTERACTIVE SIMULATOR, AUDIO SYNTHESIS & CANVAS KNOWLEDGE GRAPH -->\n  <script>\n    // =========================================================================\n    // 1. SOUND SYNTHESIS ENGINE (Web Audio API - Zero External Dependencies)\n    // =========================================================================\n    let audioCtx = null;\n    let soundEnabled = true;\n\n    function initAudio() {\n      if (!audioCtx) {\n        audioCtx = new (window.AudioContext || window.webkitAudioContext)();\n      }\n    }\n\n    function toggleAudio() {\n      soundEnabled = !soundEnabled;\n      document.getElementById(\"sound-state\").innerText = soundEnabled ? \"ON\" : \"OFF\";\n      document.getElementById(\"btn-sound-toggle\").classList.toggle(\"text-cyan-400\", soundEnabled);\n    }\n\n    function playSynthSound(type) {\n      if (!soundEnabled) return;\n      try {\n        initAudio();\n        if (audioCtx.state === 'suspended') {\n          audioCtx.resume();\n        }\n\n        const now = audioCtx.currentTime;\n\n        if (type === 'blip') {\n          const osc = audioCtx.createOscillator();\n          const gain = audioCtx.createGain();\n          osc.type = 'sine';\n          osc.frequency.setValueAtTime(880, now);\n          osc.frequency.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(1760, now + 0.08);\n          gain.gain.setValueAtTime(0.08, now);\n          gain.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.001, now + 0.08);\n          osc.connect(gain);\n          gain.connect(audioCtx.destination);\n          osc.start(now);\n          osc.stop(now + 0.08);\n        } else if (type === 'type') {\n          const osc = audioCtx.createOscillator();\n          const gain = audioCtx.createGain();\n          osc.type = 'triangle';\n          osc.frequency.setValueAtTime(320 + Math.random() * 80, now);\n          gain.gain.setValueAtTime(0.04, now);\n          gain.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.001, now + 0.03);\n          osc.connect(gain);\n          gain.connect(audioCtx.destination);\n          osc.start(now);\n          osc.stop(now + 0.03);\n        } else if (type === 'heal') {\n          const osc = audioCtx.createOscillator();\n          const gain = audioCtx.createGain();\n          osc.type = 'sawtooth';\n          osc.frequency.setValueAtTime(440, now);\n          osc.frequency.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(880, now + 0.2);\n          gain.gain.setValueAtTime(0.09, now);\n          gain.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.001, now + 0.25);\n          osc.connect(gain);\n          gain.connect(audioCtx.destination);\n          osc.start(now);\n          osc.stop(now + 0.25);\n        } else if (type === 'alarm') {\n          // Harsh two-tone warning klaxon\n          const osc = audioCtx.createOscillator();\n          const gain = audioCtx.createGain();\n          osc.type = 'sawtooth';\n          osc.frequency.setValueAtTime(220, now);\n          osc.frequency.setValueAtTime(160, now + 0.15);\n          osc.frequency.setValueAtTime(220, now + 0.3);\n          gain.gain.setValueAtTime(0.15, now);\n          gain.gain.exponentialRampToValueAtTime(0.001, now + 0.5);\n          osc.connect(gain);\n          gain.connect(audioCtx.destination);\n          osc.start(now);\n          osc.stop(now + 0.5);\n        }\n      } catch (e) {\n        console.warn(\"Audio synthesis error:\", e);\n      }\n    }\n\n    // =========================================================================\n    // 2. CANVAS EPISODIC MEMORY GRAPH VISUALIZATION\n    // =========================================================================\n    const canvas = document.getElementById(\"memory-canvas\");\n    const ctx = canvas.getContext(\"2d\");\n\n    function resizeCanvas() {\n      canvas.width = canvas.parentElement.clientWidth;\n      canvas.height = canvas.parentElement.clientHeight;\n    }\n    window.addEventListener(\"resize\", resizeCanvas);\n    setTimeout(resizeCanvas, 50);\n\n    const memoryNodes = [\n      { id: \"vendor\", label: \"Vendor Field\", x: 0.25, y: 0.25, color: \"#38bdf8\", pulse: 0, connectedTo: [\"invoice\", \"submit\"] },\n      { id: \"invoice\", label: \"Invoice ID\", x: 0.75, y: 0.25, color: \"#38bdf8\", pulse: 0, connectedTo: [\"amount\"] },\n      { id: \"amount\", label: \"Amount ($)\", x: 0.25, y: 0.65, color: \"#38bdf8\", pulse: 0, connectedTo: [\"submit\"] },\n      { id: \"notes\", label: \"Audit Memo\", x: 0.75, y: 0.65, color: \"#38bdf8\", pulse: 0, connectedTo: [\"submit\"] },\n      { id: \"submit\", label: \"Submit Action\", x: 0.50, y: 0.85, color: \"#10b981\", pulse: 0, connectedTo: [] },\n      { id: \"purge\", label: \"Audit Purge [RISK]\", x: 0.85, y: 0.88, color: \"#ef4444\", pulse: 0, connectedTo: [] }\n    ];\n\n    let driftVectorAnim = null; // { fromX, fromY, toX, toY, progress }\n\n    function animateMemoryGraph() {\n      ctx.clearRect(0, 0, canvas.width, canvas.height);\n      const w = canvas.width;\n      const h = canvas.height;\n\n      // Draw subtle background grid\n      ctx.strokeStyle = \"rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.05)\";\n      ctx.lineWidth = 1;\n      const step = 30;\n      for (let x = 0; x < w; x += step) {\n        ctx.beginPath(); ctx.moveTo(x, 0); ctx.lineTo(x, h); ctx.stroke();\n      }\n      for (let y = 0; y < h; y += step) {\n        ctx.beginPath(); ctx.moveTo(0, y); ctx.lineTo(w, y); ctx.stroke();\n      }\n\n      // Draw Connection Edges\n      memoryNodes.forEach(node => {\n        const nx = node.x * w;\n        const ny = node.y * h;\n        node.connectedTo.forEach(targetId => {\n          const target = memoryNodes.find(n => n.id === targetId);\n          if (target) {\n            const tx = target.x * w;\n            const ty = target.y * h;\n            ctx.beginPath();\n            ctx.strokeStyle = \"rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.35)\";\n            ctx.lineWidth = 1.5;\n            ctx.moveTo(nx, ny);\n            ctx.lineTo(tx, ty);\n            ctx.stroke();\n\n            // Subtle moving particle along edge\n            const time = Date.now() * 0.0015;\n            const t = (time + (nx + ny) * 0.01) % 1;\n            const px = nx + (tx - nx) * t;\n            const py = ny + (ty - ny) * t;\n            ctx.fillStyle = \"rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.8)\";\n            ctx.beginPath();\n            ctx.arc(px, py, 2.5, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n            ctx.fill();\n          }\n        });\n      });\n\n      // Draw Self-Healing Relocalization Vector if active\n      if (driftVectorAnim) {\n        driftVectorAnim.progress += 0.02;\n        if (driftVectorAnim.progress > 1) driftVectorAnim.progress = 1;\n\n        ctx.save();\n        ctx.strokeStyle = \"#f59e0b\";\n        ctx.lineWidth = 2.5;\n        ctx.setLineDash([4, 4]);\n        ctx.beginPath();\n        ctx.moveTo(driftVectorAnim.fromX * w, driftVectorAnim.fromY * h);\n        const curX = (driftVectorAnim.fromX + (driftVectorAnim.toX - driftVectorAnim.fromX) * driftVectorAnim.progress) * w;\n        const curY = (driftVectorAnim.fromY + (driftVectorAnim.toY - driftVectorAnim.fromY) * driftVectorAnim.progress) * h;\n        ctx.lineTo(curX, curY);\n        ctx.stroke();\n        ctx.restore();\n\n        // Arrow head / target reticle\n        ctx.strokeStyle = \"#f59e0b\";\n        ctx.beginPath();\n        ctx.arc(curX, curY, 8, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n        ctx.stroke();\n      }\n\n      // Draw Nodes\n      memoryNodes.forEach(node => {\n        const nx = node.x * w;\n        const ny = node.y * h;\n\n        // Glow ring\n        if (node.pulse > 0) {\n          node.pulse -= 0.03;\n          ctx.beginPath();\n          ctx.arc(nx, ny, 16 + (1 - node.pulse) * 18, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n          ctx.strokeStyle = `rgba(56, 189, 248, ${node.pulse})`;\n          ctx.lineWidth = 2;\n          ctx.stroke();\n        }\n\n        // Outer dot\n        ctx.beginPath();\n        ctx.arc(nx, ny, 7, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n        ctx.fillStyle = node.color;\n        ctx.fill();\n\n        // Inner dot\n        ctx.beginPath();\n        ctx.arc(nx, ny, 3, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n        ctx.fillStyle = \"#ffffff\";\n        ctx.fill();\n\n        // Label\n        ctx.font = \"10px 'JetBrains Mono', monospace\";\n        ctx.fillStyle = \"#94a3b8\";\n        ctx.textAlign = \"center\";\n        ctx.fillText(node.label, nx, ny - 12);\n      });\n\n      requestAnimationFrame(animateMemoryGraph);\n    }\n    requestAnimationFrame(animateMemoryGraph);\n\n    function pulseNode(id) {\n      const node = memoryNodes.find(n => n.id === id);\n      if (node) {\n        node.pulse = 1.0;\n        playSynthSound('blip');\n      }\n    }\n\n    // =========================================================================\n    // 3. VIRTUAL DESKTOP ACTUATION & DEMO ORCHESTRATION\n    // =========================================================================\n    const cursor = document.getElementById(\"virtual-cursor\");\n    const cursorRing = document.getElementById(\"cursor-target-ring\");\n    const desktop = document.getElementById(\"desktop-viewport\");\n\n    let isDemoRunning = false;\n    let isDrifted = false;\n    let settledCount = 0;\n\n    function moveCursorToElement(elementId, callback) {\n      const el = document.getElementById(elementId);\n      if (!el) return;\n      const elRect = el.getBoundingClientRect();\n      const deskRect = desktop.getBoundingClientRect();\n\n      const targetX = elRect.left - deskRect.left + (elRect.width / 2);\n      const targetY = elRect.top - deskRect.top + (elRect.height / 2);\n\n      cursor.style.left = `${targetX}px`;\n      cursor.style.top = `${targetY}px`;\n      document.getElementById(\"telemetry-coords\").innerText = `CURSOR: (${Math.round(targetX)}, ${Math.round(targetY)})`;\n\n      setTimeout(() => {\n        // Trigger click visual\n        cursor.classList.add(\"clicking\");\n        cursorRing.style.opacity = \"1\";\n        cursorRing.style.transform = \"scale(1)\";\n        playSynthSound('type');\n\n        setTimeout(() => {\n          cursor.classList.remove(\"clicking\");\n          cursorRing.style.opacity = \"0\";\n          cursorRing.style.transform = \"scale(0.5)\";\n          if (callback) callback();\n        }, 180);\n      }, 480);\n    }\n\n    function typeIntoInput(inputId, text, onComplete) {\n      moveCursorToElement(inputId, () => {\n        const input = document.getElementById(inputId);\n        input.value = \"\";\n        let i = 0;\n        const interval = setInterval(() => {\n          input.value += text[i];\n          playSynthSound('type');\n          i++;\n          if (i >= text.length) {\n            clearInterval(interval);\n            setTimeout(onComplete, 200);\n          }\n        }, 28);\n      });\n    }\n\n    function addLog(msg, type = \"info\") {\n      const log = document.getElementById(\"telemetry-log\");\n      const d = new Date();\n      const timeStr = `[${d.toTimeString().split(' ')[0]}]`;\n      const div = document.createElement(\"div\");\n      div.className = \"py-0.5\";\n\n      if (type === \"warn\") div.className += \" text-amber-400\";\n      else if (type === \"crit\") div.className += \" text-rose-400 font-bold\";\n      else if (type === \"success\") div.className += \" text-emerald-400\";\n      else div.className += \" text-cyan-400\";\n\n      div.innerText = `${timeStr} ${msg}`;\n      log.appendChild(div);\n      log.scrollTop = log.scrollHeight;\n    }\n\n    function addLedgerRecord(voucher, vendor, amount) {\n      settledCount++;\n      document.getElementById(\"ledger-count\").innerText = `${settledCount} records`;\n      const tbody = document.getElementById(\"ledger-rows\");\n      if (settledCount === 1) tbody.innerHTML = \"\";\n\n      const d = new Date();\n      const tr = document.createElement(\"tr\");\n      tr.className = \"hover:bg-slate-50 transition\";\n      tr.innerHTML = `\n        <td class=\"p-1 text-slate-500\">${d.toTimeString().split(' ')[0]}</td>\n        <td class=\"p-1 font-bold text-blue-700\">${voucher}</td>\n        <td class=\"p-1 text-slate-800\">${vendor}</td>\n        <td class=\"p-1 text-right font-bold text-emerald-700\">$${amount.toLocaleString('en-US', {minimumFractionDigits: 2})}</td>\n      `;\n      tbody.prepend(tr);\n    }\n\n    function clearInputs() {\n      document.getElementById(\"input-vendor\").value = \"\";\n      document.getElementById(\"input-invoice\").value = \"\";\n      document.getElementById(\"input-amount\").value = \"\";\n      document.getElementById(\"input-notes\").value = \"\";\n    }\n\n    // =========================================================================\n    // 4. THE 3 ACTS OF THE HACKATHON WINNING DEMO\n    // =========================================================================\n\n    // ACT 1: THE HANDS (Zero-Chat Actuation)\n    function runAct1(nextAct) {\n      document.getElementById(\"system-status-text\").innerText = \"ACT I: THE HANDS // MOTOR ACTUATION\";\n      document.getElementById(\"system-status-badge\").className = \"px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-cyan-950/80 border border-cyan-500/40 text-cyan-300 flex items-center space-x-2\";\n      document.getElementById(\"graph-active-task\").innerText = \"INV-2026-001 (APEX CLOUD)\";\n      addLog(\">>> ACT I: MOTOR ACTUATION & MUSCLE MEMORY ENGAGED\", \"info\");\n      addLog(\"Directive received: Settle voucher INV-2026-001 ($1,450.00)\", \"info\");\n\n      pulseNode(\"vendor\");\n      typeIntoInput(\"input-vendor\", \"Apex Cloud Systems\", () => {\n        pulseNode(\"invoice\");\n        typeIntoInput(\"input-invoice\", \"INV-2026-001\", () => {\n          pulseNode(\"amount\");\n          typeIntoInput(\"input-amount\", \"1450.00\", () => {\n            pulseNode(\"notes\");\n            typeIntoInput(\"input-notes\", \"Monthly server compute cluster allocation\", () => {\n              pulseNode(\"submit\");\n              addLog(\"Muscle memory match: Submitting voucher to Win32 ERP.\", \"success\");\n              moveCursorToElement(\"btn-erp-submit\", () => {\n                addLedgerRecord(\"INV-2026-001\", \"Apex Cloud Systems\", 1450.00);\n                addLog(\"✔ Voucher INV-2026-001 committed to ledger database.\", \"success\");\n                clearInputs();\n                setTimeout(nextAct, 1800);\n              });\n            });\n          });\n        });\n      });\n    }\n\n    // ACT 2: SELF-LEARNING & ADAPTATION (Chaos Sabotage)\n    function runAct2(nextAct) {\n      document.getElementById(\"system-status-text\").innerText = \"ACT II: SELF-LEARNING // CHAOS DRIFT\";\n      document.getElementById(\"system-status-badge\").className = \"px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-amber-950/80 border border-amber-500/40 text-amber-300 flex items-center space-x-2\";\n      document.getElementById(\"graph-active-task\").innerText = \"INV-2026-002 (DATACORE)\";\n      addLog(\">>> ACT II: SIMULATING UNEXPECTED UI ENTROPY\", \"warn\");\n      addLog(\"Injecting