hes crimson: `⛔ BOUNDARY CONTRACT BREACH DETECTED`.\n   - Generates a SHA-256 cryptographic **Proof-of-Boundary**, leaving the ledger 100% untampered.","TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\Piyush\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\e426a91e-3961-4012-84ca-1849c4385ef7\\walkthrough.md","toolAction":"Updating walkthrough.md","toolSummary":"Add web frontend section to walkthrough.md"}}]}
